#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:128
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:129
#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:132
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:130
msgid "−3.78"
msgstr "−3.78"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:131
msgid "3Ga-H"
msgstr "3Ga-H"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:133
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:134
msgid "−3.41"
msgstr "−3.41"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:136
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"どちらも負なので、絶対零度では、Ga原子もH原子も、孤立したGa原子やH₂分子でいるより表面に吸着した方が安定です。\\ 3Ga-H "
"の値はH原子3個分で、1個あたりでは−1.14 eVです。\\ 吸着した原子が離れるかどうかは、気相の化学ポテンシャル "
":math:`\\tilde{\\mu}` との競合で決まります。"
msgstr ""
"Both adsorption energies are negative, so at absolute zero both Ga and H "
"atoms are more stable adsorbed on the surface than as an isolated Ga atom"
" or H₂ molecule. \\ The value for 3Ga-H is for three H atoms, or −1.14 eV"
" per H atom. \\ Whether the adatoms desorb depends on the competition "
"with the gas-phase chemical potential :math:`\\tilde{\\mu}`."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:141
msgid "成長条件と分圧"
msgstr "Growth Conditions and Partial Pressures"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:143
msgid ""
"式 :eq:`gan-delta-g` に入れる分圧は、成長部での分圧です。\\ "
"原料のTMGはGa原子にほぼ完全に分解しますが、NH₃は一部しか分解しません。\\ 論文 [2]_ は、NH₃の分解率を "
":math:`\\alpha` = 0.25とし、"
msgstr ""
"Equation :eq:`gan-delta-g` uses the partial pressures in the growth zone."
" \\ The TMG precursor decomposes almost completely into Ga atoms, but NH₃"
" decomposes only partially. \\ Kusaba et al. [2]_ set the NH₃ "
"decomposition fraction to :math:`\\alpha` = 0.25 and use the reactions"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:147
msgid ""
"\\mathrm{(CH_3)_3Ga + \\tfrac{3}{2}H_2 \\rightarrow Ga + 3CH_4}, \\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{NH_3 \\rightarrow \\tfrac{\\alpha}{2}N_2 + "
"\\tfrac{3\\alpha}{2}H_2 + (1-\\alpha)NH_3}"
msgstr ""
"\\mathrm{(CH_3)_3Ga + \\tfrac{3}{2}H_2 \\rightarrow Ga + 3CH_4}, \\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{NH_3 \\rightarrow \\tfrac{\\alpha}{2}N_2 + "
"\\tfrac{3\\alpha}{2}H_2 + (1-\\alpha)NH_3}"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:152
msgid "の分解の後の分圧を"
msgstr "to obtain the following partial pressures after decomposition:"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:154
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"p_\\mathrm{Ga} &= c\\,p^0_\\mathrm{TMG}, \\qquad\n"
"p_\\mathrm{NH_3} = c\\,(1-\\alpha)\\,p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}, \\\\\n"
"p_\\mathrm{H_2} &= c\\left(F\\,p^0_\\mathrm{carrier} + "
"\\tfrac{3\\alpha}{2}p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}\\right), \\qquad\n"
"p_\\mathrm{N_2} = c\\left((1-F)\\,p^0_\\mathrm{carrier} + "
"\\tfrac{\\alpha}{2}p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}\\right)\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"p_\\mathrm{Ga} &= c\\,p^0_\\mathrm{TMG}, \\qquad\n"
"p_\\mathrm{NH_3} = c\\,(1-\\alpha)\\,p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}, \\\\\n"
"p_\\mathrm{H_2} &= c\\left(F\\,p^0_\\mathrm{carrier} + "
"\\tfrac{3\\alpha}{2}p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}\\right), \\qquad\n"
"p_\\mathrm{N_2} = c\\left((1-F)\\,p^0_\\mathrm{carrier} + "
"\\tfrac{\\alpha}{2}p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}\\right)\n"
"\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:164
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"としています。\\ :math:`p^0` は入口での分圧で、キャリアガスの分圧は :math:`p^0_\\mathrm{carrier} = "
"p^0_\\mathrm{tot} - p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3} - p^0_\\mathrm{TMG}` です。\\ "
":math:`F` はキャリアガスのうちH₂の割合（N₂キャリアで0、H₂キャリアで1）、 :math:`c` "
"は全圧を保つための規格化定数です。\\ このページでも論文と同じく、全圧 :math:`p^0_\\mathrm{tot}` = 1 atm、 "
":math:`p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}` = 0.5 atmとし、V/III比 "
":math:`p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}/p^0_\\mathrm{TMG}` を500〜5000の範囲で変えます。\\ "
"Gaの分圧はV/III比に反比例し、V/III = 500で約 :math:`9\\times10^{-4}` atm、5000で約 "
":math:`9\\times10^{-5}` atmです。\\ H₂の分圧は、N₂キャリアでもNH₃の分解で約0.17 "
"atmあり、H₂キャリアでは約0.61 atmになります。\\ どちらも、V/III比ではほとんど変わりません。"
msgstr ""
"Here, \\ :math:`p^0` denotes the inlet partial pressures. The carrier gas"
" partial pressure is :math:`p^0_\\mathrm{carrier} = p^0_\\mathrm{tot} - "
"p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3} - p^0_\\mathrm{TMG}`. \\ :math:`F` is the H₂ fraction "
"of the carrier gas (0 for N₂ carrier and 1 for H₂ carrier), and :math:`c`"
" is a normalization constant that preserves the total pressure. \\ As in "
"the paper, we set the total pressure to :math:`p^0_\\mathrm{tot}` = 1 atm"
" and :math:`p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}` = 0.5 atm, and vary the V/III ratio "
":math:`p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}/p^0_\\mathrm{TMG}` from 500 to 5000. \\ The Ga "
"partial pressure is inversely proportional to the V/III ratio: about "
":math:`9\\times10^{-4}` atm at V/III = 500 and about "
":math:`9\\times10^{-5}` atm at 5000. \\ Even with N₂ as the carrier, NH₃ "
"decomposition produces an H₂ partial pressure of about 0.17 atm. With H₂ "
"as the carrier, it is about 0.61 atm. \\ Both H₂ partial pressures change"
" little with the V/III ratio."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:173
