msgstr "Gas-Phase Chemical Potential"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:175
msgid "気相の分子を理想気体とみなすと、化学ポテンシャルは並進・回転・振動の分配関数から"
msgstr ""
"For gas-phase molecules treated as an ideal gas, the translational, "
"rotational, and vibrational partition functions give the chemical "
"potential"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:177
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\tilde{\\mu} &= -k_\\mathrm{B}T "
"\\ln\\left(g\\,\\frac{k_\\mathrm{B}T}{p}\\,\\zeta_\\mathrm{trans}\\,\\zeta_\\mathrm{rot}\\,\\zeta_\\mathrm{vib}\\right),\\\\"
"\n"
"\\zeta_\\mathrm{trans} &= \\left(\\frac{2\\pi m "
"k_\\mathrm{B}T}{h^2}\\right)^{3/2},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\zeta_\\mathrm{rot} = \\frac{k_\\mathrm{B}T}{\\sigma h c B},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\zeta_\\mathrm{vib} = \\frac{1}{1 - e^{-h c\\,\\omega / k_\\mathrm{B}T}}"
"\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\tilde{\\mu} &= -k_\\mathrm{B}T "
"\\ln\\left(g\\,\\frac{k_\\mathrm{B}T}{p}\\,\\zeta_\\mathrm{trans}\\,\\zeta_\\mathrm{rot}\\,\\zeta_\\mathrm{vib}\\right),\\\\"
"\n"
"\\zeta_\\mathrm{trans} &= \\left(\\frac{2\\pi m "
"k_\\mathrm{B}T}{h^2}\\right)^{3/2},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\zeta_\\mathrm{rot} = \\frac{k_\\mathrm{B}T}{\\sigma h c B},\n"
"\\quad\n"
"\\zeta_\\mathrm{vib} = \\frac{1}{1 - e^{-h c\\,\\omega / k_\\mathrm{B}T}}"
"\n"
"\\end{aligned}"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:189
msgid ""
"と書けます [2]_ 。\\ :math:`m` は分子の質量、 :math:`g` は電子状態の縮重度、 :math:`\\sigma` "
"は対称数（H₂では2）、 :math:`B` と :math:`\\omega` は波数単位の回転定数と振動数です。\\ "
"論文にならい、振動の分配関数には零点振動の因子を含めていません。\\ Ga原子は並進だけで、基底状態 :sup:`2`\\ P\\ "
":sub:`1/2` の縮重度 :math:`g` = 2を使います。"
msgstr ""
"as given in Ref. [2]_. \\ :math:`m` is the molecular mass, :math:`g` is "
"the degeneracy of the electronic state, :math:`\\sigma` is the symmetry "
"number (2 for H₂), and :math:`B` and :math:`\\omega` are the rotational "
"constant and vibrational frequency in wavenumber units. \\ Following the "
"paper, we omit the zero-point vibration factor from the vibrational "
"partition function. \\ For the Ga atom, we include only translation and "
"use the ground-state :sup:`2`\\ P\\ :sub:`1/2` degeneracy of :math:`g` = "
"2."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:194
msgid ""
"H₂の回転定数と振動数は、Psi4で構造を最適化した後の振動数解析から取ります（ :numref:`tab-gan-h2` ）。\\ "
"PBEの値は実験値より振動数が約2 %、回転定数が約2.5 %小さくなっています。"
