"We obtain the rotational constant and vibrational frequency of H₂ from "
"vibrational analysis after geometry optimization with Psi4 (:numref:`tab-"
"gan-h2`). \\ The PBE vibrational frequency is about 2 % below the "
"experimental value, and the rotational constant is about 2.5 % below the "
"experimental value."

