msgid ""
":math:`\\frac{3}{2}\\tilde{\\mu}_\\mathrm{H_2}` "
"の大半は並進の寄与で、分圧によって変わるのもこの項です。\\ 回転の寄与は約−0.37 eVあり、無視できません。\\ "
"一方、振動の寄与は−0.002 eVしかありません。\\ H₂の振動数（約4300 cm⁻¹）は1100 °Cの熱エネルギー "
":math:`k_\\mathrm{B}T` （約950 cm⁻¹）よりずっと大きく、振動はほとんど励起されないからです。\\ "
"Psi4の値を実験値に置き換えても、 :math:`\\frac{3}{2}\\tilde{\\mu}_\\mathrm{H_2}` は5 "
"meVしか変わりません。"
msgstr ""
"Translation accounts for most of "
":math:`\\frac{3}{2}\\tilde{\\mu}_\\mathrm{H_2}`, and it is also the term "
"that varies with the partial pressure. \\ The rotational contribution is "
"about −0.37 eV, too large to neglect. \\ By contrast, the vibrational "
"contribution is only −0.002 eV. \\ The H₂ vibrational frequency (about "
"4300 cm⁻¹) far exceeds the thermal energy :math:`k_\\mathrm{B}T` at 1100 "
"°C (about 950 cm⁻¹), so the vibration is hardly excited. \\ Replacing the"
" Psi4 values with the experimental values changes "
":math:`\\frac{3}{2}\\tilde{\\mu}_\\mathrm{H_2}` by only 5 meV."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:241
msgid "表面相図"
msgstr "Surface Phase Diagram"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:243
msgid ""
"成長温度900〜1300 °C、V/III比500〜5000の範囲で、 :math:`\\Delta G` が最も低い表面を選びます。\\ "
"まず、V/III = 5000での3つの表面の :math:`\\Delta G` を温度に対して比べ（ :numref:`fig-gan-"
"delta-g` ）、次に、温度とV/III比のそれぞれの点で最も安定な表面を塗り分けた相図（ :numref:`fig-gan-phase` "
"）を論文の相図と比べます。"
msgstr ""
"For growth temperatures from 900 to 1300 °C and V/III ratios from 500 to "
"5000, we select the surface with the lowest :math:`\\Delta G`. \\ We "
"first compare the :math:`\\Delta G` of the three surfaces as a function "
"of temperature at V/III = 5000 (:numref:`fig-gan-delta-g`). We then "
"compare the phase diagram, in which each temperature and V/III ratio is "
"colored by the most stable surface (:numref:`fig-gan-phase`), with the "
"phase diagram in the paper."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:250
msgid ""
"V/III = 5000での各表面のギブズエネルギー（Ideal "
"基準、2×2表面セルあたり）。左がN₂キャリア、右がH₂キャリアです。各温度で最も低い線の表面が安定です。"
msgstr ""
"Gibbs energy of each surface at V/III = 5000, relative to Ideal and per "
"2×2 surface cell. The left panel uses N₂ carrier and the right panel uses"
" H₂ carrier. At a given temperature, the lowest curve identifies the "
"stable surface."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:252
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"温度が上がると、 :math:`-\\tilde{\\mu}` は大きくなるので、吸着した表面の :math:`\\Delta G` "
"は上がっていきます。\\ 吸着した表面のうち最も低い :math:`\\Delta G` が0を横切ると、Ideal が最も安定になります。\\ "
"N₂キャリアでは、Ga adatom の線が全温度で 3Ga-H の線より下にあり、1148 °Cで Ga adatom から Ideal "
"へ移ります。\\ H₂キャリアでは、H₂の分圧が高い分だけ "
":math:`\\frac{3}{2}\\tilde{\\mu}_\\mathrm{H_2}` が上がり（ :numref:`tab-gan-"
"mu-parts` ）、3Ga-H の線が下がって Ga adatom の線と入れ替わります。\\ 3Ga-H は1174 °Cで Ideal "
"へ移ります。\\ Ga adatom の線はキャリアガスによって変わりません。\\ Gaの分圧がキャリアガスによらないからです。"
msgstr ""
"As the temperature increases, :math:`-\\tilde{\\mu}` increases, so the "
":math:`\\Delta G` of the surfaces with adatoms rises. \\ Ideal becomes "
"the most stable surface when the lowest :math:`\\Delta G` among the "
"surfaces with adatoms crosses zero. \\ With N₂ carrier, the Ga adatom "
"curve stays below the 3Ga-H curve throughout the temperature range, and "
"the stable surface changes from Ga adatom to Ideal at 1148 °C. \\ With H₂"
" carrier, the higher H₂ partial pressure raises "
":math:`\\frac{3}{2}\\tilde{\\mu}_\\mathrm{H_2}` (:numref:`tab-gan-mu-"
"parts`), which lowers the 3Ga-H curve so that it swaps places with the Ga"
" adatom curve. \\ 3Ga-H gives way to Ideal at 1174 °C. \\ The Ga adatom "
"curve does not change with the carrier gas. \\ This is because the Ga "
"partial pressure does not depend on the carrier gas."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:260
msgid ""
"この比較を温度とV/III比のそれぞれの点で行い、 :math:`\\Delta G` が最も低い表面を塗り分けたのが :numref:`fig-"
"gan-phase` です。"
msgstr ""
"Making this comparison at each temperature and V/III ratio and coloring "
"each point by the surface with the lowest :math:`\\Delta G` gives :numref"
":`fig-gan-phase`."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:266
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"GaN(0001)面の表面相図。左がN₂キャリア、右がH₂キャリアです。全圧1 atm、 :math:`p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}` ="
" 0.5 atm、 :math:`\\alpha` = 0.25。各点で式 :eq:`gan-delta-g` の :math:`\\Delta "
"G` が最も低い表面の色で塗っています（温度2 °C、V/III比25刻み）。"
msgstr ""
"Surface phase diagram for GaN(0001). The left panel uses N₂ carrier and "
"the right panel uses H₂ carrier. The total pressure is 1 atm, "
":math:`p^0_\\mathrm{NH_3}` = 0.5 atm, and :math:`\\alpha` = 0.25. At each"
" point, we use Equation :eq:`gan-delta-g` to calculate :math:`\\Delta G` "
"and color the point by the surface with the lowest value (steps of 2 °C "
"in temperature and 25 in V/III ratio)."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:268
msgid "相図から次のことが読み取れます。"
msgstr "The phase diagram shows the following."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:270
msgid ""
"N₂キャリアでは、低温で Ga adatom、高温で Ideal が現れます。境界の温度は、V/III = 500で1252 "
"°C、5000で1148 °Cです。V/III比が大きいほどGaの分圧が低く、Ga原子が離れやすいので、境界は低温側へ移ります。"
msgstr ""
"With N₂ carrier, Ga adatom is stable at low temperatures and Ideal at "
"high temperatures. The boundary is at 1252 °C for V/III = 500 and 1148 °C"
" for V/III = 5000. A higher V/III ratio lowers the Ga partial pressure, "
"making it easier for Ga atoms to desorb and shifting the boundary to "
"lower temperatures."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:271
msgid ""
"H₂キャリアでは、V/III比が約2750以上（900 °Cでは約3000以上）の領域に 3Ga-H が現れます。3Ga-H と Ideal "
"の境界は約1174 "
"°Cで、V/III比にほとんどよりません。H₂の分圧はNH₃の分解とキャリアガスで決まり、V/III比ではほとんど変わらないからです。"
msgstr ""
"With H₂ carrier, 3Ga-H appears at V/III ratios of about 2750 or higher "
"(about 3000 or higher at 900 °C). The boundary between 3Ga-H and Ideal is"
" at about 1174 °C and depends very little on the V/III ratio. This is "
"because the H₂ partial pressure is set by NH₃ decomposition and the "
"carrier gas and changes little with the V/III ratio."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:272
msgid ""
"V/III比が小さい側では、H₂キャリアでも Ga adatom が現れ、Ideal との境界はN₂キャリアと同じです。Ga adatom と "
"Ideal の :math:`\\Delta G` は、H₂の分圧によらないからです。"
msgstr ""
"At low V/III ratios, Ga adatom also appears with H₂ carrier, and its "
"boundary with Ideal is the same as with N₂ carrier. This is because the "
":math:`\\Delta G` values of Ga adatom and Ideal do not depend on the H₂ "
"partial pressure."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:274
msgid ""
"論文 [2]_ のFig. 2と比べると、現れる表面の種類と並び方は同じです。\\ N₂キャリアで Ga adatom から Ideal "
"へ移り、V/III比が大きいほど境界が低温になること、H₂キャリアで高V/III側に 3Ga-H が現れ、さらに高温で Ideal "
"に移ることが一致しています。\\ 一方、境界の位置はずれています。\\ N₂キャリアの境界は、論文の図ではV/III = 5000で約1110 "
"°C、500で約1200 °Cで、このページの計算は約40〜50 °C高温側にあります。\\ H₂キャリアの 3Ga-H と Ideal "
"の境界は、論文の図の約1160 °Cに対し、このページでは約1174 °Cです。\\ H₂キャリアで 3Ga-H "
"が現れるV/III比の下限は、論文の図では約1200で、このページでは約2750です。"
msgstr ""
"Compared with Fig. 2 of the paper [2]_, the same surface types appear in "
"the same order. \\ Both diagrams show that, with N₂ carrier, the surface "
"changes from Ga adatom to Ideal, with the boundary at lower temperatures "
"for higher V/III ratios, and that, with H₂ carrier, 3Ga-H appears at high"
" V/III ratios and gives way to Ideal at even higher temperatures. \\ "
"However, the boundaries are at different positions. \\ With N₂ carrier, "
"the paper's figure puts the boundary at about 1110 °C for V/III = 5000 "
"and about 1200 °C for V/III = 500, and our calculated boundary is about "
"40–50 °C higher. \\ With H₂ carrier, the boundary between 3Ga-H and Ideal"
" is at about 1174 °C on this page, compared with about 1160 °C in the "
"paper's figure. \\ With H₂ carrier, the minimum V/III ratio at which "
"3Ga-H appears is about 1200 in the paper's figure and about 2750 on this "
"page."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:281
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"境界の温度は吸着エネルギーに敏感で、このずれは吸着エネルギーの0.1 eV程度の違いに当たります。\\ "
":math:`\\tilde{\\mu}_\\mathrm{Ga}` の温度変化は約−2.8 meV/Kなので、 "
":math:`E_\\mathrm{ads}` の0.1 eVの違いは、境界の温度で約35 °Cに当たります。\\ 論文の図の境界で "
":math:`\\Delta G` が0になる吸着エネルギーを、このページの :math:`\\tilde{\\mu}` "
"を使って逆算すると、論文の吸着エネルギーは Ga adatom で約−3.65 eV、3Ga-H で約−3.37 eVと推定されます。\\ "
"このページの値（ :numref:`tab-gan-eads` ）は、それぞれ約0.13 eV、0.04 "
"eV安定側にあり、境界が高温側にずれたことと整合します。\\ Ga adatom の方が大きく安定側にあるので、Ga adatom と 3Ga-H"
" の境界も高V/III側へ移ります。\\ "
"計算コードと基底関数（DMol3の数値基底とQEの平面波・PAW）、Ga原子の参照の取り方などの違いが、この程度の差になって現れていると考えられます。"
msgstr ""
"The boundary temperature is sensitive to the adsorption energy, and these"
" shifts correspond to differences of about 0.1 eV in the adsorption "
"energy. \\ :math:`\\tilde{\\mu}_\\mathrm{Ga}` has a temperature slope of "
"about −2.8 meV/K, so a difference of 0.1 eV in :math:`E_\\mathrm{ads}` "
"corresponds to about 35 °C in the boundary temperature. \\ Back-"
"calculating the adsorption energies at which :math:`\\Delta G` is zero on"
" the boundaries in the paper's figure, using our :math:`\\tilde{\\mu}`, "
"gives estimates of the paper's adsorption energies: about −3.65 eV for Ga"
" adatom and about −3.37 eV for 3Ga-H. \\ Our values (:numref:`tab-gan-"
"eads`) are more stable (lower) by about 0.13 eV and 0.04 eV, "
"respectively, consistent with the shift of the boundaries to higher "
"temperatures. \\ Because Ga adatom is stabilized by more, the boundary "
"between Ga adatom and 3Ga-H also shifts toward higher V/III ratios. \\ "
"Differences in the code and basis set (the numerical basis in DMol3 "
"versus plane waves with PAW in QE), in how the Ga atom reference is "
"chosen, and in other details likely appear as differences of this size."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:291
msgid "Ga adatom の吸着サイト"
msgstr "Adsorption Site of the Ga Adatom"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:293
msgid ""
"Ga adatom のGa原子をどこに置くかで、結果は変わります。\\ "
"Ga原子はT4サイトが最も安定ですが、H3サイト（スラブを通して真下に原子がない位置）に置いても構造最適化は収束し、その構造から相図を描けます。\\"
" GaNに限らず、準安定な吸着サイトがある表面の安定性を調べるときは、収束した構造がどのサイトに対応するかを確かめる必要があります。\\ "
":numref:`fig-gan-site` に、H3サイトとT4サイトに置いた場合の相図を比べます。"
msgstr ""
"Where the Ga atom of the Ga adatom is placed changes the result. \\ Ga is"
" most stable at the T4 site. However, if we place the Ga atom at the H3 "
"site (with no atom directly below it anywhere in the slab), geometry "
"optimization still converges, and we can use that structure to plot a "
"phase diagram. \\ When assessing the stability of a surface with "
"metastable adsorption sites, whether on GaN or another material, we need "
"to identify the site in the converged structure. \\ :numref:`fig-gan-"
"site` compares phase diagrams for Ga at the H3 and T4 sites."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:302
msgid ""
"Ga adatom の吸着サイトによる違い。上段がH3サイト、下段がT4サイトです。左端の図は最上層を上から見た図で、太い輪郭がGa adatom"
" です。相図の条件は :numref:`fig-gan-phase` と同じです。"
msgstr ""
"Effect of the Ga adatom adsorption site. The top row shows the H3 site "
"and the bottom row shows the T4 site. The panels on the far left show the"
" topmost layer from above, with a thick outline around the Ga adatom. The"
" phase diagrams use the same conditions as :numref:`fig-gan-phase`."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:304
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"T4サイトはH3サイトより0.226 eV安定です（ :math:`E_\\mathrm{ads}` = −3.78 eVと−3.55 "
"eV）。\\ H3サイトのままでは、N₂キャリアでも高V/III側に 3Ga-H が現れ、H₂キャリアでは Ga adatom "
"が全く現れません。\\ どちらも論文の相図とは異なります。\\ T4サイトに置いた場合（下段）は :numref:`fig-gan-phase` "
"と同じ相図で、現れる表面の種類と並び方が論文と一致します。"
msgstr ""
"The T4 site is more stable than the H3 site by 0.226 eV "
"(:math:`E_\\mathrm{ads}` = −3.78 eV and −3.55 eV, respectively). \\ With "
"the adatom at H3, 3Ga-H appears at high V/III ratios even with N₂ "
"carrier, and Ga adatom does not appear at all with H₂ carrier. \\ Both "
"results differ from the published phase diagram. \\ With the adatom at "
"the T4 site (bottom row), the phase diagram is the same as :numref:`fig-"
"gan-phase`, and the surface types that appear and their order agree with "
"the paper."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:309
msgid ""
"構造最適化（BFGS）は、原子に働く力に沿って原子を動かします。\\ "
"高い対称性の位置に置いた原子には、その対称性を破る向きの力が働かないので、原子は別のサイトへ移りません。\\ "
"構造最適化が収束しても、「その位置が最も安定」の証拠にはなりません。\\ "
"吸着サイトは、最適化した後の座標から、吸着原子の真下に何の原子があるかで確かめます。\\ :doc:`reproduction` "
"の解析スクリプトは、この判定をしてから表面の名前を付けます。"
msgstr ""
"Geometry optimization (BFGS) moves atoms in response to the forces acting"
" on them. \\ An atom placed at a high-symmetry position experiences no "
"force in a direction that breaks that symmetry, so it does not move to "
"another site. \\ Convergence of geometry optimization does not establish "
"that the site is the most stable one. \\ We identify the adsorption site "
"from the optimized coordinates by checking which atom lies directly below"
" the adatom. \\ :doc:`reproduction` provides the analysis script. The "
"script performs this check before assigning a name to the surface."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:318
msgid "適用範囲"
msgstr "Applicability"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:320
msgid "このページの相図は、次の近似と条件の下でのものです。"
msgstr ""
"The phase diagram applies under the following approximations and "
"conditions."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:322
msgid ""
"論文の9通りの表面構造 [2]_ のうち3つだけを比べています。ここで比べていない表面構造（Ga adlayer、N adatom "
"など）の方が安定な条件では、相図は変わります。"
msgstr ""
"We compare only three of the nine surface structures studied in the paper"
" [2]_. The phase diagram will change under conditions where one of the "
"structures we did not compare, such as Ga adlayer or N adatom, is more "
"stable."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:323
msgid "(000−1)面は扱っていません。N面のスラブの底面には、価数1.25の擬水素が要ります。"
msgstr ""
"We do not consider the (000−1) face. The bottom of the N-face slab "
"requires pseudo-hydrogen with a valence of 1.25."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:324
msgid "表面の原子の振動は含めていません。気相の分子の振動は含めていますが、零点振動のエネルギーは気相・表面とも含めていません（論文と同じ）。"
msgstr ""
"We omit vibrations of surface atoms. We include vibrations of gas-phase "
"molecules, but omit the energy of zero-point vibrations for both the gas "
"phase and the surface, as in the paper."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:325
msgid ""
"スラブの計算はスピン分極を考えていません。Ga原子の参照エネルギーはスピン分極ありで計算しました。Ga原子をスピン分極なしで計算すると全エネルギーが0.245"
" eV高くなり、Ga adatom の吸着エネルギーが同じだけ変わります。"
msgstr ""
"The slab calculations omit spin polarization. We computed the Ga atom "
"reference energy with spin polarization. Without spin polarization, the "
"Ga atom's total energy is 0.245 eV higher, and the adsorption energy of "
"Ga adatom changes by the same amount."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:326
msgid ""
"底面の擬水素は、QEの ``ld1.x`` で作ったノルム保存型の擬ポテンシャルです。原子の自己無撞着計算と ``pw.x`` "
"での1原子の計算は通りましたが、表面での転移性やカットオフエネルギーへの収束は確かめていません。"
msgstr ""
"The pseudo-hydrogen at the bottom of the slab uses a norm-conserving "
"pseudopotential generated with QE's ``ld1.x``. The self-consistent "
"calculation for the atom and the single-atom calculation with ``pw.x`` "
"ran successfully, but we have not checked transferability to the surface "
"or convergence with respect to cutoff energy."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:327
msgid ""
"スラブの計算はQE 7.6、Ga原子とH₂の計算はQE 7.5で行いました（ :numref:`tab-gan-conditions` "
"）。版による全エネルギーの違いは確かめていません。"
msgstr ""
"We ran the slab calculations with QE 7.6 and the Ga atom and H₂ "
"calculations with QE 7.5 (:numref:`tab-gan-conditions`). We have not "
"checked how much the total energies differ between the two versions."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:328
msgid ""
"成長部の分圧は、論文の分解モデル（式 :eq:`gan-pressure` ）によります。分解率 :math:`\\alpha` "
"を変えると、特にH₂の分圧と 3Ga-H の領域が変わります。"
msgstr ""
"The partial pressures in the growth zone follow the decomposition model "
"from the paper (Equation :eq:`gan-pressure`). Varying the decomposition "
"fraction :math:`\\alpha` changes the H₂ partial pressure and the 3Ga-H "
"region in particular."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:332
msgid ""
"quemix.com の `Quloudの紹介ページ <https://www.quemix.com/quloud>`__ "
"に掲載した同じ計算の相図は、計算条件がこのページと2点違う段階のものでした（H₂のQEの計算のカットオフが50 Ry、Ideal "
"のスメアリングの補正なし）。\\ そのときの吸着エネルギーは Ga adatom で−3.73 eV、3Ga-H で−3.36 "
"eVで、相境界はこのページより約17 °C低温側にありました。相図の形は同じです。"
msgstr ""
"The phase diagram of the same calculation posted on the quemix.com "
"`Quloud overview page <https://www.quemix.com/quloud>`__ dates from a "
"stage when two calculation conditions differed from those on this page (a"
" cutoff of 50 Ry for the QE calculation of H₂, and no smearing correction"
" for Ideal). \\ At that stage, the adsorption energy was −3.73 eV for Ga "
"adatom and −3.36 eV for 3Ga-H, and the phase boundary was about 17 °C "
"lower than on this page. The shape of the phase diagram was the same."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:336
msgid "この数値実験から分かること"
msgstr "What the Numerical Experiment Shows"

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:338
msgid ""
"表面の吸着エネルギー（QE）と気相の化学ポテンシャル（Psi4の振動数・回転定数と理想気体の統計力学）を組み合わせて、成長温度とV/III比に対するGaN(0001)の表面相図を描きました。N₂キャリアでは、低温で"
" Ga adatom、高温で Ideal が安定で、境界はV/III比が大きいほど低温になります（V/III = 500で1252 "
"°C、5000で1148 °C）。"
msgstr ""
"We combined the adsorption energy of each surface (QE) with the gas-phase"
" chemical potentials (from the Psi4 vibrational frequency and rotational "
"constant with ideal-gas statistical mechanics) to plot the surface phase "
"diagram of GaN(0001) as a function of growth temperature and V/III ratio."
" With N₂ carrier, Ga adatom is stable at low temperatures and Ideal at "
"high temperatures, and the boundary is at lower temperatures for higher "
"V/III ratios (1252 °C at V/III = 500 and 1148 °C at 5000)."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:339
msgid ""
"キャリアガスをH₂に替えると、H₂の分圧が約0.17 atmから約0.61 atmに上がり、V/III比が約2750以上の領域で、H原子が吸着した"
" 3Ga-H が約1174 °Cまで安定になります。V/III比が小さい側の Ga adatom と Ideal の境界は変わりません。"
msgstr ""
"Switching the carrier gas to H₂ raises the H₂ partial pressure from about"
" 0.17 atm to about 0.61 atm, and 3Ga-H, with adsorbed H atoms, becomes "
"stable up to about 1174 °C at V/III ratios of about 2750 or higher. At "
"low V/III ratios, the boundary between Ga adatom and Ideal does not "
"change."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:340
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"3Ga-H の :math:`\\Delta G` に入る "
":math:`\\frac{3}{2}\\tilde{\\mu}_\\mathrm{H_2}` （1100 "
"°C）では、並進に次いで回転の寄与（約−0.37 eV）が大きく、振動の寄与は−0.002 "
"eVでした。Psi4の振動数と回転定数を実験値に置き換えても、この量は5 meVしか変わりません。"
msgstr ""
"In the :math:`\\Delta G` of 3Ga-H, the term "
":math:`\\frac{3}{2}\\tilde{\\mu}_\\mathrm{H_2}` (at 1100 °C) has its "
"largest contribution from translation, followed by rotation (about −0.37 "
"eV), and the vibrational contribution is −0.002 eV. Replacing the Psi4 "
"vibrational frequency and rotational constant with experimental values "
"changes this quantity by only 5 meV."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:341
msgid ""
"現れる表面の種類と並び方は論文 [2]_ と同じで、境界の温度はN₂キャリアで約40〜50 "
"°C高温側にずれました。このずれは、吸着エネルギーの0.1 eV程度の違い（Ga adatom で約0.13 eV）に当たります。"
msgstr ""
"The surface types that appear and their order are the same as in the "
"paper [2]_, but with N₂ carrier the boundary temperatures are shifted "
"about 40–50 °C higher. This shift corresponds to a difference of about "
"0.1 eV in the adsorption energy (about 0.13 eV for Ga adatom)."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:342
msgid ""
"Ga adatom をH3サイトに置いても構造最適化は収束しますが、T4サイトより0.226 "
"eV不安定で、相図が変わります。吸着サイトは、最適化した後の座標で確かめる必要があります。"
msgstr ""
"Even with Ga adatom placed at the H3 site, geometry optimization "
"converges, but the structure is 0.226 eV less stable than with the T4 "
"site, and the phase diagram changes. The adsorption site needs to be "
"checked using the coordinates after optimization."

#: ../../gan_surface/phase_diagram.rst:344
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"この相図は、3つの表面構造だけを比べ、表面の原子の振動を含めず、論文の分解モデルの分圧を使ったものです（ :numref:`{number}. "
"{name} <gan-scope>` ）。"
msgstr ""
"This phase diagram compares only three surface structures, omits "
"vibrations of the surface atoms, and uses partial pressures from the "
"decomposition model in the paper (:numref:`{number}. {name} <gan-"
"scope>`)."

